# mdBook output
/book/book/

# WSDL-generated DSLs — the WSDL under wsdl/<group>/ is the
# source of truth; XTR regenerates the .yml files under
# DSL/<group>/ on every boot. Ignoring the outputs keeps PRs
# from churning on marker-header lines and preserves the
# "WSDL is canonical" invariant. Task 013.
#
# Rule: for each WSDL-driven group, add an entry here.
# Hand-written groups (like DSL/xroad/) stay tracked.
/DSL/ar/*.yml

# Claude Code working state
/.claude/

# Environment
.env
.env.local
constants.local.ini
